{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "What Happened Last Night?", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Life in the Fast Lane", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " The Unreal Past: Expressing Wishes and Regrets ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "To talk about the unreal past, you use past tenses to describe hypothetical situations. You use the <span class=\"strong\">Past Perfect </span>tense for unlikely or unreal situations in the past or to express wishes and regrets.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you want to talk about a situation in the present that you regret or would like to change, you use <span class=\"italic\">I wish</span> and the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> tense.<br/> Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I wish</span> we got along better.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It means that we are not getting along, but it would be nice if we could get along better.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you want to talk about situations in the past that you regret, you weren't happy about or that you would have liked to change, you use <span class=\"strong\">I wish</span> and the <span class=\"strong\">Past Perfect</span> tense.<br/> Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I wish</span> I <span class=\"strong\">had found </span> out about online dating a long time ago.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It means I didn't know about online dating in the past, but it would have been better for me if I had known about it in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the following examples from the text. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Sometimes<span class=\"strong\"> I wish I had </span> all the time in the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I wish we could have gotten</span> together sooner.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I wish I had done</span> something like this a long time ago. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I wish I could</span> remember, but I forgot what I was going to say.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Colloquial Expressions about Time", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Colloquial expressions are idioms that you use frequently, especially in spoken English. There are many expressions that refer to time in English.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Colloquial expressions about time can refer to different aspects of time. You can use these to express different ideas related to time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here are some colloquial expressions:<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Lack of time:</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">pressed for time<br/> run out of time<br/> no time to lose</span><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have enough time:</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">all the time in the world<br/> take your time<br/> make good time<br/> free time</span><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">The right time for something:</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">just in time<br/> in the nick of time<br/> high time<br/> no time like the present</span><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you have any<span class=\"strong\"> free time</span>, you should come by and visit as well.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I know you're <span class=\"strong\">pressed for time</span>, so which days of the week are available for you?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There is <span class=\"strong\">no time like the present</span>.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "But Amy was able to <span class=\"strong\">find the time</span> and now she's a life coach.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sometimes I <span class=\"strong\">wish I had</span> all the time in the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I thought it was<span class=\"strong\"> high time </span>I got some life advice.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "find the time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make time for", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Amy was able to find the time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about time.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "no time like the present ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used to suggest that something should be done now rather than later", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Never hesitate in doing something. There is no time like the present. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pressed for time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "needing time; in a hurry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I know you're pressed for time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "free time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "time that is free from duties or responsibilities", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: And Peter, if you have any free time you should come by and visit.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "high time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a point in time at which something is considered to be due to happen; similar to \"it's about time\"", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I thought it was high time I got some life advice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "all the time in the world", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an unlimited amount of time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sometimes I wish I had all the time in the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, research six time idioms you think your classmates might not know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Learn their definition, their use and have an example of each one ready.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Split with your partner and join another group.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take turns teaching each other your time idioms.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take notes on each new idiom.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Vote on which idioms are the most useful.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I find six time word idioms.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I learn the definitions and write examples related to the idiom.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present my idioms to my group members clearly and concisely.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I listen for gist and for detail.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give feedback on my favorite idiom.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"content": "birds of a feather", "type": "name"}, {"content": "people who think and/or behave in a similar way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It seems we've always been birds of a feather. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le13ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn10le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn10le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "50", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Amy and I know each other from a class we took a while back about life coaching.\nIt seems we've always been birds of a feather.\nIf only I had had more time and money, I would have continued on with my studies. But Amy was able to find the time and now she's a life coach. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Huh? That's very intriguing. Sometimes I wish I had all the time in the world.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, and she is going to help me out a little bit. I thought it was high time I got some life advice and when I saw Amy on Friday in the restaurant we talked about it, and now I'm ready to try. We get along so well.  I wish we could have gotten together sooner."}, {"image": "engenn10le13ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "37000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: There is no time like the present. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, there isn't. Now, Amy. I know you're pressed for time, so which days of the week are available for you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Tuesdays and Thursdays. You want to meet twice a week? Around 1:30 at my office.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Perfect!"}, {"image": "engenn10le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "56000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: See you Tuesday. And Peter, if you have any free time you should come by and visit as well. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If only Peter had a life, then he could use a coach.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Haha. No one likes her very much.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: See you later Vanessa. I think we are going to work well together. Bye Peter.<br/>"}, {"image": "engenn10le13ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "74000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Bye. She seems cool.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She is. I wish I had done something like this a long time ago. So, you were going to tell me about Friday night.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You know what, I wish I could remember, but I forgot what I was going to say."}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le13ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le13ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about relationships and character traits, and use colloquial expressions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express wishes and regrets.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can use colloquial expressions about time.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you think a life coach does?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Would you go see a life coach? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Meeting with a life coach!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa introduces Peter to Amy. She's a life coach.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something 